    "description": "Single-line insight for a feed or panel — severity icon, title, meta and an optional action. 10 variants: severity (success, danger, warning, info) × state (default, hover) plus ghost=true placeholders. ghost is the empty placeholder row. Props: Title, Meta (text), showAction + action (instance swap). Stack rows in a List; for the same content as a standalone card use Insight Card.",
