  "overlay": {
    "file": "spec/overlay/insight-row.yaml",
    "rules": [
      {
        "rule": "base",
        "at": "base",
        "reason": "Bespoke on both: a card of the family (shells/card.mjs), drawn from Figma's layers, its severity a bar named by its word and its action the caller's Button; pressable where it is given something to do, its title then the stretched action (owner decision 2026-09-25)."
      },
      {
        "rule": "rename",
        "at": "ghost",
        "reason": "Figma's ghost is the row loading, its placeholders drawn: `loading`, as Card's is, a boolean of its own beside the severity (owner decision 2026-09-25). Figma draws it at info alone, which the shells draw it as, whatever the severity."
